<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "11A">
<servcat sctnbr = "11" scnbr = "01">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0AB106013" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
DC/DC Converter Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0AB106012">DC/DC Converter Removal and Installation</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Check the following points. If any abnormalities are found, correct them.
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Accessories are not connected to terminals.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Terminals are not dusty or loose.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Wires are not pinched.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fixing bolts of DC/DC converter are not loose.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Cabin floor for DC/DC converter is not wet.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Ventilation opening of DC/DC converter cover is not obstructed.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
DC/DC converter cover is not detached.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that DC/DC converter fan smoothly without any abnormal noise.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check DC/DC converter for crack and deformation. If any abnormality is found, replace it. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0AB106012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
